#: mason/breeders_toolbox/create_seedlots_from_trial_dialogs.mas:143
msgctxt "seedlot.each_seedlot_needs_to_have_its_initial_contents_either_a"
msgid ""
"Each seedlot needs to have its initial contents (either a count or a weight) set.  You\n"
"                                can either set the same initial value for each seedlot, use the value from one of the\n"
"                                traits recorded for this trial, or compute a new value from the recorded traits for this\n"
"                                trial.  If you are creating a seedlot for each accession and select a trait or a computed\n"
"                                value as their initial value, then the sum of the trait values for each of the accession's\n"
"                                plots will be used.  The contents of each seedlot can be modified in the table below\n"
"                                before its creation."
msgstr "Cada lote debe tener un contenido inicial (cantidad o peso). Puede asignar el mismo valor a todos, usar un carácter registrado en el ensayo o calcular un nuevo valor a partir de los caracteres registrados. Si crea un lote por accesión y usa un carácter o valor calculado, se sumarán los valores de sus parcelas. Puede modificar el contenido de cada lote en la tabla antes de crearlo."

